---
// Pastor section
---

<section id="pastor" class="px-6 lg:px-12 py-24 lg:py-32 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">
    <div class="relative reveal">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=800&q=85" alt="Pastor Daniel Mwangi" class="w-full h-[500px] lg:h-[600px] object-cover">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
        <span class="inline-block w-8 h-px bg-gold"></span>
        <span class="section-badge">Our Leadership</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(32px,3.5vw,48px)] mb-2">Pr. Daniel Mwangi</h2>
      <p class="text-gold text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide mb-6">Senior Pastor</p>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-text-secondary text-[16px] leading-relaxed max-w-[520px] mb-8">
        <p>With a heart for ministry and a passion for sharing the Gospel, Pastor Daniel Mwangi leads our congregation with wisdom, compassion, and a genuine love for God's people.</p>
        <p>Trained at Bugema University and ordained in 2010, Pastor Mwangi has faithfully served churches across East Africa before joining Nyaura in 2021.</p>
      </div>
      <blockquote class="p-6 bg-surface rounded-xl border-l-2 border-gold text-navy">
        <p class="font-heading text-lg italic leading-relaxed">"Come as you are. God has a plan for your life, and it starts with you taking the first step through those doors."</p>
      </blockquote>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-border">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          <i data-lucide="mail" class="w-4 h-4 text-gold"></i>
          <span class="text-navy font-medium">pastor@nyaurachurch.org</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-sm text-text-secondary">
          <i data-lucide="phone" class="w-4 h-4 text-gold"></i>
          <span class="text-navy font-medium">+254 7XX XXX XXX</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
